#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1039 expect=noViolation domain=CM
#note "Row 1: CMCAT distinct from every comparator -> clean. Row 2: CMCAT empty AND CMTRT/CMDECOD empty - the leading not empty(--CAT) gate is false, so the both-empty equalsIgnoreCase match (B.3: '' equalsIgnoreCase '' is true) is never reached -> clean. Row 2 is load-bearing: it pins the gate shielding the both-empty corner."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset CM class=INTERVENTIONS label="Concomitant Medications"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col CMSEQ    type=Num
col CMTRT    type=Char
col CMDECOD  type=Char
col CMCAT    type=Char
---
S1 | CM | 001 | 1 | ASPIRIN |  ACETYLSALICYLIC ACID | ANALGESICS
S1 | CM | 001 | 2 |         |                       |
---
